t+1 \\\\ t(1-t)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}-2xt & =1 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}-\\frac{2xt}{t(1-t)} & =\\frac{1}{t(1-t)} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}-\\frac{2x}{1-t} & =\\frac{1}{t(1-t)} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}+\\frac{2x}{t-1} & =\\frac{1}{t(1-t)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\nP(t)=\\frac{2}{t-1},\\,Q(t)=\\frac{1}{t(1-t)}.\n$$" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339101 13194139535236 true] [17592186339100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339102 13194139535236 true] [17592186339100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339103 13194139535236 true] [17592186339100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339104 13194139535236 true] [17592186339100 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535236 true] [17592186339100 1041 "field-1" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339100 1104 #edb/ref 17592186339102 13194139535236 true] [17592186339100 1110 #uuid "c0b321ee-223c-5c04-88d7-787e60bd30e0" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339101 1034 "\\frac{2}{t}" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339101 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535236 true] [17592186339101 1111 #uuid "9d8511f6-b720-522d-9040-efc7a18dc15f" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339102 1034 "\\frac{2}{t-1}" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339102 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535236 true] [17592186339102 1111 #uuid "12a52341-b0c9-52fd-a097-edecf8b68331" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339103 1034 "\\frac{1}{t(t-1)}" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339103 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535236 true] [17592186339103 1111 #uuid "006c8ac8-966c-526e-811b-0349c9de1812" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339104 1034 "\\frac{1}{t-2}" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339104 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535236 true] [17592186339104 1111 #uuid "48be27cd-e17f-569a-a557-2f25b2fa8d2a" 13194139535236 true] [17592186339105 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339106 13194139535236 true] [17592186339105 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339107 13194139535236 true] [17592186339105 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339108 13194139535236 true] [1759218633